{"2882350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystery Box 5: Elements", "steam_appid": 2882350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/13516a571af2b9ae6ee1c94ea543ed91.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/13516a571af2b9ae6ee1c94ea543ed91.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new series of intricate boxes filled with alluring enigmas and brain-teasing challenges that will leave you a lasting impression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/8b43f1961eab11701d3ae6d660e8378a.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/8b43f1961eab11701d3ae6d660e8378a.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 10 boxes of the game and play this extra challenge in the room of the <strong>Elements Stone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/634d10a556382b16e322e1c07345e45a.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/634d10a556382b16e322e1c07345e45a.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a straightforward user interface and captivating puzzles, this game promises an engaging experience that expertly balances challenge and entertainment, keeping you engaged for hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/7f54a79203ff0d509e5342b8f1bbf4f5.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/7f54a79203ff0d509e5342b8f1bbf4f5.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Box has its music theme, for you to play this adventure in a transcendental way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/694ee9d525a027c1a2765136902f8753.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/694ee9d525a027c1a2765136902f8753.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the bulb button in the scene to get a hint that will help you solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you got really stuck on a puzzle, feel free to get in touch with the developer to get some more hints</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/63b2ad9177d4824f260a32d8a8c671f5.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/63b2ad9177d4824f260a32d8a8c671f5.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your community and friends know what you're playing and how far you've gone in this escape room adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/a2f9707f7f1855beebdede83a6ee0896.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/13516a571af2b9ae6ee1c94ea543ed91.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/13516a571af2b9ae6ee1c94ea543ed91.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a new series of intricate boxes filled with alluring enigmas and brain-teasing challenges that will leave you a lasting impression</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/8b43f1961eab11701d3ae6d660e8378a.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/8b43f1961eab11701d3ae6d660e8378a.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock all 10 boxes of the game and play this extra challenge in the room of the <strong>Elements Stone</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/634d10a556382b16e322e1c07345e45a.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/634d10a556382b16e322e1c07345e45a.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a straightforward user interface and captivating puzzles, this game promises an engaging experience that expertly balances challenge and entertainment, keeping you engaged for hours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/7f54a79203ff0d509e5342b8f1bbf4f5.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/7f54a79203ff0d509e5342b8f1bbf4f5.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Box has its music theme, for you to play this adventure in a transcendental way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/694ee9d525a027c1a2765136902f8753.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras_big/694ee9d525a027c1a2765136902f8753.avif?t=1785740378 width=1560 height=234 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click the bulb button in the scene to get a hint that will help you solve the puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In case you got really stuck on a puzzle, feel free to get in touch with the developer to get some more hints</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2882350/extras/63b2ad9177d4824f260a32d8a8c671f5.avif?t=1785740378\" data-big-src=https://s